text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Se voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o gosta de aparecer<br \\/>na c\\u00e2mera, basta capturar sua tela. <br \\/>Seja como for, recomendamos ter<br \\/>pelo menos duas horas de v\\u00eddeo para um curso pago.<\\/p><h4>Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h4><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\" data-purpose=\\\"safely-set-inner-html:how-it-works:support\\\">Nossa equipe de suporte est\\u00e1 \\u00e0 disposi\\u00e7\\u00e3o<br \\/>para ajudar voc\\u00ea no processo e oferecer <br \\/>feedback dos v\\u00eddeos de teste.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b463ed3\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1040,\"sizes\":[]},\"content_position\":\"top\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#EAF1F8\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"24\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"140\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"45\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"70\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"70\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"cbbe50e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7adcda0\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-60\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLi