=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/SGA_unibelas\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/presentation-300x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\"><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Comece com o que voc\\u00ea ama e conhece. <br>Depois, escolha um tema promissor com <br>a ajuda da nossa ferramenta.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">A maneira como voc\\u00ea ensina<br>- o seu toque especial <br>- fica a seu crit\\u00e9rio.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"udlite-heading-lg how-it-works--help-text--2g-ce\\\">Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Oferecemos muitos recursos sobre como criar <br>seu primeiro curso. Al\\u00e9m disso, o painel <br>do instrutor e as p\\u00e1ginas de grade curricular <br>ajudam voc\\u00ea a manter a organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"0a4534a\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Grave o seu Video\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><img class=\\\"wp-image-440 size-full alignright\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/SGA_unibelas\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/grave-o-seu-video.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"480\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" \\/><\\/p><div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\"><div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\"><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Use ferramentas b\\u00e1sicas, como um<br \\/>smartphone ou uma c\\u00e2mera DSLR. <br \\/>Providencie um bom microfone <br \\/>e voc\\u00ea j\\u00e1 pode come\\u00e7ar.<\\/p><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Se voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o gosta de aparecer<br \\/>na c\\u00e2mera, basta capturar sua tela. <br \\/>Seja como for, recomendamos ter<br \\/>pelo menos duas horas de v\\u00eddeo para um curso pago.<\\/p><h3 class=\\\"udlite-heading-lg how-it-works--help-text--2g-ce\\\">Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h3><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\" data-purpose=\\\"safely-set-inner-html:how-it-works:support\\\">Nossa equipe de suporte est\\u00e1 \\u00e0 disposi\\u00e7\\u00e3o<br \\/>para ajudar voc\\u00ea no processo e oferecer <br \\/>feedback dos v\\u00eddeos de teste.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"f7f8204\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Lance o seu Curso\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><img class=\\\"wp-image-441 size-full alignright\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/SGA_unibelas\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/lancar-o-curso.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"480\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" \\/><\\/p><div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\"><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Comece com o que voc\\u00ea ama e conhece. <br \\/>Depois, escolha um tema promissor com <br \\/>a ajuda da nossa ferramenta.<\\/p><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">A maneira como voc\\u00ea ensina<br \\/>- o seu toque especial <br \\/>- fica a seu crit\\u00e9rio.<\\/p><h3 class=\\\"udlite-heading-lg how-it-works--help-text--2g-ce\\\">Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h3><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Oferecemos muitos recursos sobre como criar <br \\/>seu primeiro curso. Al\\u00e9m disso, o painel <br \\/>do instrutor e as p\\u00e1ginas de grade curricular <br \\/>ajudam voc\\u00ea a manter a organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p><\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"6f9d2b1\"}],\"tabs_align_horizontal\":\"center\",\"tab_color\":\"#131313\",\"tab_active_color\":\"#F07D06\",\"tab_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"tab_typography_font_family\":\"Times New Roman\",\"tab_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":23,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"content_color\":\"#282727\",\"content_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"content_typography_font_family\":\"Yantramanav\",\"content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"content_typography_font_weight\":\"400\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"tabs\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3aceff74\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2f7f8f29\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ba02f37\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[tutor_instructor_registration_form]\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]');
