r\":\"<p>Amplie sua rede profissional, desenvolva seu conhecimento e ganhe dinheiro com cada inscri\\u00e7\\u00e3o paga.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"text_color\":\"#121111\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"73c66db6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":941,\"sizes\":[]},\"content_position\":\"top\",\"background_color\":\"#EAF1F8\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"140\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"45\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"70\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"70\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"60aed97e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-82\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"404f162e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Comece Assim\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-31\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"22\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"30942fc6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"Paneje sua Grade Curricular\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><img class=\\\"size-medium wp-image-404 alignright\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/SGA_unibelas\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/presentation-300x300.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"300\\\"><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Comece com o que voc\\u00ea ama e conhece. <br>Depois, escolha um tema promissor com <br>a ajuda da nossa ferramenta.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">A maneira como voc\\u00ea ensina<br>- o seu toque especial <br>- fica a seu crit\\u00e9rio.<\\/p>\\n<h4>Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Oferecemos muitos recursos sobre como criar <br>seu primeiro curso. Al\\u00e9m disso, o painel <br>do instrutor e as p\\u00e1ginas de grade curricular <br>ajudam voc\\u00ea a manter a organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"0a4534a\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Grave o seu Video\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><img class=\\\"wp-image-440 size-full alignright\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/SGA_unibelas\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/grave-o-seu-video.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"480\\\" height=\\\"480\\\"><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Use ferramentas b\\u00e1sicas, como um<br>smartphone ou uma c\\u00e2mera DSLR. <br>Providencie um bom microfone <br>e voc\\u00ea j\\u00e1 pode come\\u00e7ar.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Se voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o gosta de aparecer<br>na c\\u00e2mera, basta capturar sua tela. <br>Seja como for, recomendamos ter<br>pelo menos duas horas de v\\u00eddeo para um curso pago.<\\/p>\\n<h4>Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\" data-purpose=\\\"safely-set-inner-html:how-it-works:support\\\">Nossa equipe de suporte est\\u00e1 \\u00e0 disposi\\u00e7\\u00e3o<br>para ajudar voc\\u00ea no processo e oferecer <br>feedback dos v\\u00eddeos de teste.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"f7f8204\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Lance o seu Curso\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><img class=\\\"wp-image-441 size-full alignright\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/SGA_unibelas\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2021\\/08\\/lancar-o-curso.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"480\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" \\/><\\/p><div class=\\\"how-it-works--text--13tNL\\\"><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Promova seu curso em m\\u00eddias sociais e redes profissionais para receber suas primeiras classifica\\u00e7\\u00f5es e avalia\\u00e7\\u00f5es.<\\/p><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Seu curso poder\\u00e1 ser encontrado no nosso marketplace, onde voc\\u00ea vai gerar receita com cada inscri\\u00e7\\u00e3o paga.<\\/p><h4>Como ajudamos voc\\u00ea<\\/h4><p class=\\\"udlite-text-md teach-page__margin-center\\\">Oferecemos muitos recursos sobre como criar <br \\/>seu primeiro curso. Al\\u00e9m disso, o painel <br \\/>do instrutor e as p\\u00e1ginas de grade curricular <br \\/>ajudam voc\\u00ea a manter a organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p><\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"6f9d2b1\"}],\"tabs_align_horizontal\":\"center\",\"tab_color\":\"#131313\",\"tab_active_color\":\"#0676F0\",\"tab_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"tab_typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"tab_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":23,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"content_color\":\"#282727\",\"content_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"content_typography_font_family\":\"Yantramanav\",\"content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"content_typography_font_weight\":\"400\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"tabs\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d4fb8f3\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_position\":\"top\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color