(488, 1, '2022-07-17 13:34:41', '2022-07-17 13:34:41', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.7 - 03-07-2022 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Aprenda na sua agenda</h2>		\n		<p>em qualquer lugar, a qualquer hora. comece a aprender hoje</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost/SGA_unibelas/inscricao-de-alunos/\" role=\"button\">\n						Começar Agora\n					</a>\n			<h2>últimos Cursos Publicados</h2>		\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-dashboard-completo-htmlt-css-js-e-php/\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/sco/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/hq720-1.jpg\" alt=\"Curso Dashboard Completo  (HTMLT, CSS, JS E PHP)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n<h3 title=\"Curso Dashboard Completo  (HTMLT, CSS, JS E PHP)\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-dashboard-completo-htmlt-css-js-e-php/\">Curso Dashboard Completo  (HTMLT, CSS, JS E PHP)</a>\n</h3>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">\n            S        </a>\n                By\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">Sessa</a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-dashboard-completo-htmlt-css-js-e-php/lesson/dashboard-completo-com-php-mysql-e-bootstrap-5-curso-passo-a-passo-aula-1/\" data-course_id=\"746\">\n            Comece a aprender        </a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-marketing-digital/\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/sco/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/marketing-digital-768x509.png\" alt=\"Curso de Marketing Digital\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n                    2.00\n            (1)\n<h3 title=\"Curso de Marketing Digital\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-marketing-digital/\">Curso de Marketing Digital</a>\n</h3>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">\n            S        </a>\n                By\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">Sessa</a>\n<a href=\"http://localhost/sco?cert_hash=7abfd395c96b114a\">\n					Download Certificate\n				</a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-completo-de-fundamentos-de-redes/\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/sco/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/a0e2fbcdd218693394d187e767c5271e_XL.jpg\" alt=\"Curso Completo de Fundamentos de Redes\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n<h3 title=\"Curso Completo de Fundamentos de Redes\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-completo-de-fundamentos-de-redes/\">Curso Completo de Fundamentos de Redes</a>\n</h3>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">\n            S        </a>\n                By\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">Sessa</a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-completo-de-fundamentos-de-redes/lesson/as-redes-hoje-arquitetura-de-redes-de-computadores/\" data-course_id=\"118\">\n            Comece a aprender        </a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-programacao-java-orientado-a-objectos/\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/sco/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/a9ea13237c0502159263f017095ec8e6_XL.jpg\" alt=\"Curso de Programação Java Orientado a Objectos\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n                    4.00\n            (1)\n<h3 title=\"Curso de Programação Java Orientado a Objectos\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-programacao-java-orientado-a-objectos/\">Curso de Programação Java Orientado a Objectos</a>\n</h3>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">\n            S        </a>\n                By\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">Sessa</a>\n<a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-programacao-java-orientado-a-objectos/\">\n                        Comece a aprender\n                    </a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-programacao-php-orientado-a-objectos/\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/sco/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/e4710ea0caa54c5d561a4702a971c28e_XL.jpg\" alt=\"Curso de Programação PHP Orientado a Objectos\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n<h3 title=\"Curso de Programação PHP Orientado a Objectos\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-programacao-php-orientado-a-objectos/\">Curso de Programação PHP Orientado a Objectos</a>\n</h3>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">\n            S        </a>\n                By\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">Sessa</a>\n<a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/curso-de-programacao-php-orientado-a-objectos/\">\n                        Comece a aprender\n                    </a>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/javascript-curso-completo/\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/sco/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/javascript.jpg\" alt=\"JavaScript – Curso Completo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n                    3.00\n            (1)\n<h3 title=\"JavaScript – Curso Completo\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/courses/javascript-curso-completo/\">JavaScript – Curso Completo</a>\n</h3>\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/sco/profile/super_admin?view=instructor\">\n            S        </a>\n                By\n 